      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Interesting race with formlines tying in. POWER OF SUCCESS (4) finished a long neck off WHATJEUDOIN' at Doomben last time after leading them up. Goes up 2kgs with the apprentice getting taken off for Thompson. The untried 2443m is the query but he's sure to give a sight. AYASAKI (5) split the two already mentioned, only beaten a nose, and just under a length by CIGAR MAN at this track before that. Distance won't be an issue and the draw will see him play a stalking role. WHATJEUDOIN' (2) was too strong for them last time and will get a tempo to suit. Graham just has to make sure they aren't too far ahead when straightening. DRACENA (3) brings different form and is knocking on the door. This is her first try at the distance but the tempo should suit and she can be coming off their backs late.",
